              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Pet 2.9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ariko mwebweho, Uwiteka yarabajyanye abakura muri rya tanura ryubakishijwe icyuma, ni ryo Egiputa kugira ngo mumubere ubwoko bwa gakondo, uko muri na bugingo n'ubu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.20.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 20.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi Uwiteka yandakariye ku bwanyu, arahira yuko ntazambuka Yorodani ngo njye mu gihugu cyiza, Uwiteka Imana yawe iguha ho gakondo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ahubwo ko nkwiriye gupfira muri iki gihugu, ko ntakwiriye kwambuka Yorodani, ariko mwebweho muzambuka muhindūre icyo gihugu cyiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwirinde mwe kwibagirwa isezerano ry'Uwiteka Imana yanyu yasezeranye namwe, ngo mwiremere igishushanyo kibajwe mu ishusho y'ikintu cyose Uwiteka Imana yawe yakubujije. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.12.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 12.29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kuko Uwiteka Imana yawe ari umuriro ukongora, ari Imana ifuha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubwo muzaba mubyaye abana n'abuzukuru, mukaba mumaze igihe kirekire muri icyo gihugu, nimwiyonona mukarema igishushanyo kibajwe mu ishusho y'ikintu cyose, mugakora icyo Uwiteka Imana yawe ibona ko ari kibi mukayirakaza, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uyu munsi ntanze ijuru n'isi ho abahamya bazabashinja, yuko muzarimbuka vuba, mukarangira mu gihugu mwambuka Yorodani mujyanwamo no guhindūra, ntimuzakimaramo igihe kirekire, ahubwo muzarimbuka rwose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.28.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Guteg 28.36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi Uwiteka azabatataniriza mu mahanga, muzasigara muri bake mu mahanga Uwiteka azabimuriramo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muzakorerayo imana zabajwe n'intoki z'abantu mu biti no mu mabuye, zitareba, zitumva, zitarya, zitanukirwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.29.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 29.13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ariko niba uzashakirayo Uwiteka Imana yawe, uzayibona nuyishakisha umutima wawe wose n'ubugingo bwawe bwose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nugira ibyago, ibyo byose bikaba bikujeho, mu minsi izaza kera uzahindukirira Uwiteka Imana yawe uyumvire, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuko Uwiteka Imana yawe ari Imana y'inyebambe, ntizakureka, ntizakurimbura pe, ntizibagirwa isezerano yasezeranishije indahiro na ba sekuruza banyu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wibaze iby'ibihe byashize byakubanjirije, uhereye ku munsi Imana yaremeyeho umuntu mu isi, kandi uhereye ku mpera y'isi ukageza ku yindi mpera yayo, yuko higeze kubaho igihwanye n'iki kintu gikomeye, cyangwa ko humvikanye igihwanye na cyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbese hariho ubwo abantu bumvise ijwi ry'Imana ivuga iri hagati mu muriro, nk'uko wowe uryumvise bakabaho? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cyangwa higeze kuba imana yageragereje kwijyanira ishyanga, irikuje hagati y'irindi ibigerageresho n'ibimenyetso n'ibitangaza, n'intambara n'amaboko menshi n'ukuboko kurambutse n'ibiteye ubwoba bikomeye, bihwanye n'ibyo Uwiteka Imana yanyu yabakorereye muri Egiputa mu maso yanyu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.12.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mar 12.32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ni wowe werekewe ibyo kugira ngo umenye yuko Uwiteka ari we Mana, ari nta yindi keretse yo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ijuru ijwi ryayo ryaturutseyo, irikumvishiriza kugira ngo ikwigishe. Mu isi yakwerekeyeyo umuriro wayo mwinshi, wumva amagambo yayo yaturutse hagati muri wo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko yakundaga ba sekuruza banyu, ni cyo cyatumye itoranya urubyaro rwabo ikagukūza muri Egiputa imbaraga zayo nyinshi, ubwayo iri kumwe nawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yagukuriyeyo kwirukana imbere yawe amahanga akuruta ubwinshi, akurusha amaboko, no kukujyana mu gihugu cyabo akakiguha ho gakondo, uko kiri n'uyu munsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko uyu munsi menya iki ugishyire mu mutima wawe, yuko Uwiteka ari we Mana mu ijuru no mu isi, nta yindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ujye witondera amategeko yayo y'uburyo bwose ngutegeka uyu munsi, kugira ngo ubone ibyiza wowe n'urubyaro rwawe ruzakurikiraho, uhore iteka ryose mu gihugu Uwiteka Imana yawe iguha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
